          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, mwebge abaganza i Sodomu; mutegere amatwi ivyagezwe vy’Imana yacu, mwa bantu b’i Gomora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.15.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imig 15:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibimazi vyanyu vy’isinzi bimmariye iki? ni k’Uhoraho abaza. Ati Mpāze ivyo bimazi vyoshejwe vy’amasuguru y’intama, n’ibinure vy’ibitungwa bivyibushe; kandi simpimbarwa n’amaraso y’amashūri n’ay’ imyagazi y’intama n’ay’ amasuguru y’impene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo muje kunshengerera, ni nde aba yābabariye gupfa kunkandagirira mu rugo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
